Revealed deferred tools appended to the tools block

getFunctionDeclarations sorted every declared tool by name, so a deferred
tool revealed mid-session (tool_search, plan setup) landed somewhere in the
middle of the tools block and invalidated a provider's prompt cache for
everything after it. The other tools stay sorted by name; revealed deferred
tools follow in reveal order, which is still independent of registration
order, so a reveal only appends.

